#| "<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process's shared "
#| "libraries are using.<br>This memory is shared among all processes that "
#| "use this library.</qt>"
msgid ""
"<qt>This is approximately the amount of real physical memory that this "
"process's shared libraries are using.<br>This memory is shared among all "
"processes that use this library.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>To je wielëna fizyczny pamiãcë brëkòwóny przez nen proces do grëpë z "
"wespółdzeloną bibloteką. <br>Na pamiãc je do grëpë brëkòwónô przez  wszëtczé "
"procesë co brëkùją ti bibloteczi.</qt>"

